{"parse": {"title": "TSW-02", "pageid": 100955, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-01\" title=\"TSW-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSW-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-03\" title=\"TSW-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.97.9B.E8.8B.A6.E6.B6.88.E9.99.A4.E4.B9.8B.E6.9C.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"痛苦消除之术\">痛苦消除之术</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 痛苦消除之术</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Anatomy of Pain</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>种<span class=\"color-value\"></span>魔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>法<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>使<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>安<span class=\"color-value\"></span>眠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>让<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>前<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192302</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>托阿……哥哥！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我……我马上就来救你们！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_yanmo\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_yanmo\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>暴风雨来了……贝壳……我们的岛……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Cg-tutushizibeiyan.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Cg-tutushizibeiyan.png\">tutushizibeiyan</a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>对不起……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子躺在诊疗床上，双眼紧闭，眉头皱起，喃喃自语，困顿地挣扎着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>图图石子小姐只有睡着的时候才会变成这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>透过窗户，她关切地看着图图石子的情况，神色担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，我觉得很奇怪。在图图石子小姐清醒的时候，她从来没有表露过悲伤的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>提出“安眠”的请求时，她也没有表现出对梦魇的恐惧，就像……就像患上感冒，只需要对症下药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>除此之外，她待人友好热情，经常帮助别人，图图石子小姐是一个无私又善良的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我不明白。图图石子小姐的内心很痛苦，她为什么要表现得若无其事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，难道……她不信任我们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>可能对图图石子来说，寻求我们的帮助不是她现在的首选。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>基金会可以保障大家的安全，我们也愿意尽力提供帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我以为……我们可以成为朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>别太担心，我们应该给她更多时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们愿意提供帮助，也要等她先恢复状态，接受现在的环境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我明白了，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>希望小梅斯梅尔的人工梦游疗法能让图图石子小姐好起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>看来你们对人工梦游疗法又有一些不切实际的预想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整洁干练的治疗师走出康复房间，直白地宣布了她的态度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我之前诊断了这位“患者”，准备引导她进入梦境。但在引导开始之前，她就已经产生了自主梦境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>就像你们所看到的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不需要任何复杂的原理来分析她的梦境，她也不用躺在这张病床上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>“患者”只是陷入了一种纯粹的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔，我们……是否有别的方法来缓解图图石子小姐的痛苦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>缓解痛苦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不知道是你们把人工梦游疗法想得太伟大，还是把她的经历想得太简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我不否认人工梦游疗法的优秀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>它解决了很多因“暴雨”而产生的行为失常，有效矫正了偏执、强迫、暴力等负面人格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但它无法消除痛苦，就连缓解效果都微乎其微。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>也许梦境引导能够暂时使人的注意力从痛苦之中转移，但这是虚假的，是一种逃避手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你们太依赖人工梦游了，这不是件好事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一顿无可辩驳的训斥，只好沉默以对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔，所以图图石子不需要任何治疗，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>她不是病人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我能够提供的，仅仅是一些辅助安眠的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>比如一次热水澡、一杯热牛奶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>她很快就会醒了，我认为她具有完整健全的恢复能力，无需再待在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>语毕，冷酷的治疗师转身就走，杜绝了被继续追问的可能性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>图图石子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女的目光落到旁边的人身上，不知道想到了什么，又很轻很快地挪开了，没有引起任何注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我还是想为她……做点什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>让我想想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无法扭转的事实，就像碎了一地的玻璃碎屑难以恢复如初。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>问题有些棘手。两个人并肩靠着墙面，无言地思考着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>思考着一种治疗“伤心”的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然，一阵脚步声打断了她们的思路，像一串欢快而急切的风铃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-310816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-310816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-310816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子呢？图图石子在里面吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抓住一角洁白的衣袖，又抓住另外一个人的手，关切地问道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还没来得及回答她，她已经转过身，透过窗户，看到躺在诊疗床上的图图石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下一秒，她趴到窗上，轻轻拍打，呼唤着对方的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子，醒醒，图图石子——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正想上前去，一只手伸出来拦下了她，她的上司向她轻微摇头，示意她静观其变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我有重要的事情要告诉你，图图石子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的呼唤起了作用，诊疗床上的女孩睁开了眼睛，疑惑地寻找着这热切声音的源头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你醒了，图图石子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝气又明媚，像一只在阳光与海浪之中跳跃的海豚，引人注目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>芭卡……洛儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>没错，没错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>好了，现在有比睡觉更重要的事情，打起精神来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>是什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>是船商贸易节！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310915.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-310915.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310915.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310915.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-310915.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310915.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-310915.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310915.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>船商贸易节，马上就要开幕了！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-02"}}